**C4 (check-in and no-show), written but not yet tested.**
- **Background job:** `SettleBookingsAsync` in `BookingService` runs from the existing 30-second job.
  - An app booking still confirmed 15 minutes after its first slot starts becomes `no_show`, with no refund.
  - A checked-in booking becomes `completed` once its last slot ends.
  - A walk-in is never auto no-show but becomes `completed` after it ends.
- **ClubOS UI:** a new `CheckInDialog` looks up a booking by code and accepts a `BKKTENNIS:<code>` prefix. There are also check-in and no-show buttons in the booking detail panel.
- **API and mock:** new client methods `getBookingByCode`, `checkIn` and `markNoShow`, with mock versions that enforce the same time windows.

